{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030024533248-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030025803\"/><p>事發在石玉樓一單位。</p><p>昨日(29日)晚上11時02分，沙田秦石邨石玉樓一單位姓李(35歲)男住戶失去聯絡，家人懷疑他在上址暈倒，遂報案求助。救援人員接報到場，發現事主倒臥在上址，李男現場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。經調查後，案件列「屍體發現」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T19:20:36.480667+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T18:45:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:38:28.032851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T19:18:24.615626+00:00","content_hash":"e7536a81bc16985a6c1e2003295bc9def99138500363e01819f8baf77efc36ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}